   "page": "o-setup",
   "text": "Same look and shared fa.css as the sender canvas. Sign-in, PIN, slides and the role picker are the sender screens (P01\u2013P06) with 'I own trucks' picked; not repeated here.\n\nPersona: Musa Danladi, Musa Haulage Ltd, Kano, Gold (50% advance, 4% commission). Trucks: KJA 482 XA (Musa Ibrahim), KAN 219 BT (Sani Bello), KAN 774 RD (Bello Yusuf), KAN 108 MD (Musa drives it himself)."
  },
  "s2": {
   "x": 5760,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 460,
   "fill": "orange",
   "page": "o-work",
   "text": "Sender offers (D047): a load can carry 'Sender's offer'. The owner accepts it, or replies once with their price (2 h window). The sender pays the difference if they accept.\n\nLoad display (D046): '93% full \u00b7 28 t of 30 t' on every truck, load and trip card."
